/target
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
# Generated by packaging/icon.py at build time -- see docs/packaging.md.
/packaging/icons/

# Written beside a snapshot by egui_kittest when the compare fails: the run's
# own render and the difference against the committed PNG. Both are for
# looking at, never for keeping -- and they went into six commits by accident
# before this line existed, where they are worse than clutter, because a
# stale .old.png next to a snapshot reads as a second opinion about what the
# screen should look like.
**/tests/snapshots/*.old.png
**/tests/snapshots/*.diff.png
**/tests/snapshots/*.new.png
